<title>UK: World Bank sets $300 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets $300 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    22.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.15    PAY DATE    22.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.9625   SPREAD	FLAT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.375 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 15.MAY.00</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
